/E (Spring 2017 saw her tour the United States with her maiden collaboration SAMAAGATI, a jugalbandi bringing together Kuchipudi and Odissi. Her latest jugalbandi choreography, MEENAKSHI, features the glory of the Warrior-Goddess of Madurai, with Srividya choreographing and presenting the Kuchipudi component. SAMAAGATI has been featured across elite cultural and educational institutions, including the IITs at Dharwad, Bombay and Hyderabad, garnering praise for its strong and sensitive choreography.)
